  "body": "This beautifully presented 90m² home is a fantastic option\r\nFeaturing a new kitchen, two bathrooms and a tidy modern interior, and and is ready to become a fantastic home on its new site.\r\n\r\nCan easily be made into a 3 bedroom with ensuite if you convert the garage to a master bedroom.\r\n\r\nCurrently configured as a 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom home, there is also the option to convert the existing garage into a large third master bedroom with ensuite, creating an impressive 3-bedroom family home.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY FEATURES\r\n\r\n• Approx. 90m² floor area\r\n• 2 bedrooms with potential for a large 3rd master bedroom\r\n• 2 bathrooms\r\n• Modern new kitchen\r\n• Updated bathrooms\r\n• Spacious living area\r\n• Garage included\r\n• Flexible layout with excellent potential\r\n• Very tidy condition throughout\r\n\r\nPRICE INCLUDES\r\n\r\n• Relocation within approximately 200km of Auckland\r\n• Installation onto standard-depth pile foundations\r\n• GST\r\n\r\nOther destinations can also be considered  just ask us.\r\n\r\nNEED HELP WITH THE REST OF YOUR PROJECT?\r\n\r\nWe have 3 \"in house\" architects to draw plans and lodge your application with Council as well as geotech engineers and surveyors. A one stop shop for you! Zealand's largest selection of relocatable homes.\r\n\r\nLooking for something different?  We have a huge range of homes available for relocation\r\nBrowse more options:  https://fordebrothers.co.nz/properties/\r\n\r\nFinance options are also available talk to us about funding your project.\r\n\r\nViewings available anytime, including weekends.\r\n\r\nContact Mike today to discuss your project, arrange a viewing 0275599386\r\n\r\nKEYWORDS: transportable home, transportable dwelling, transportable building, transportable house, relocatable house, relocatable dwelling, relocatable building, removable house, removable dwelling, removable home, removable building, villa, house for removal, building for removal, dwelling for removal, home for removal, house haulage, clear my site, houses for removal, homes for removal, buildings for removal, dwellings for removal, renovate, investment, house demolition, demolition, bungalow, character home, character dwelling, character building, development, investment opportunity, developments, preloved home, preloved house, secondhand house, second hand house, portable home, portable house.",
